    each commit once, and the list ends at the runs that decide.

    The jobs are read of a run that decides and has not passed, whether it
    has finished or not. Once every run that decides has finished, the list
    is cut off after the last of them to start, and a list cut off that way
    that finds one of them cancelled since is listed again without the end.
    """

